  "content": "\n\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Полностью переработанная генерация мира (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic,</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a>)</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Более 100 заданий</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Полная оптимизация с поддержкой шейдеров</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 5 новых измерений</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Новые боссы и мобы (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adventurez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdventureZ</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction,</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist)</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Сотни НОВЫХ подземелий и структур (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Explorify</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/repurposed-structures-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures</a>)</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Ездовые&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fglobox1997.github.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fAdventureZ%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">драконы</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Тысячи строительных блоков</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Функции улучшения качества жизни, такие как&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a>&nbsp;и <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-obelisk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XP Obelisks</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ Встроенный,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">бесплатный обмен мирами</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f28903%252fbetter-mc-fabric-bmc1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">250+ модов</a></strong>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/12PUDvTmuUs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3ZdJX_Ig1vw\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></strong></span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">НЕ ЯВЛЯЕТСЯ ОФИЦИАЛЬНЫМ ПРОДУКТОМ MINECRAFT. НЕ ОДОБРЯЕТСЯ И НЕ СВЯЗАНО С MOJANG ИЛИ MICROSOFT</span><br><img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HsbLq3-05PQ\" alt=\"\"></strong></strong></span></h5>",
